<title>HONG KONG: Swire Pacific announces board change.</title>
<headline>Swire Pacific announces board change.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Pacific Ltd said on Friday Benny Wong Pui-tong has resigned from the board of directors and will be replaced by Davy Ho Cho-ying, effective March 15.</p>
<p>Ho is chairman of a number of Swire Group companies with shipping interests, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6346</p>
</text>
